main.ua: "# this is for getting the keys for the args\nGetkeys     ← (≡(⊢ ⊜□ ⊸≠@= °□)↘1&args)\nGetvalues   ← (≡(⊣ ⊜□ ⊸≠@= °□)↘1&args)\nGetArgs     ← (map Getkeys Getvalues)\nGetArgValue ← (⋕°□get□)\n\nRed        ← \"\\u001b[31m\"\nGreen      ← \"\\u001b[32m\"\nBlue       ← \"\\u001b[34m\"\nReset      ← \"\\u001b[0m\"\n\nApplyColor ← (˜ ⊂ Reset ⊂  )\nPrintUsage ← (\n  &p \"Usage\"\n  &p \"-------------------------------------------------\"\n  &p ⊂ \"takes a list of\" join ApplyColor Red\" key=value \" \"delimited by a space\"\n  &p \"example:\"\n  &p \"    uiua script.ua key=val key2=val2\"\n)\n"

